stead they can expect to see  the film in theaters at an earlier date  as variety reports the us release has  been moved up to october 1st 2021 the  reason for this is likely to be the  success of the recently released  jungxian the legend of the 10 rings  given that marvel achieved a  considerable box office result of almost  90 million us dollars in the first few  days which is not a bad amount of money  for film release in this time of  pandemic sony is hoping for a similar  result as they of course aim to achieve  the same success as with the previous  film although the recently announced ush  rating of 13 and up did not please  everyone the hype around the comic  adaption is still tremendous we're  looking forward to the face-off between  carnage and vanaman eagerly away the new  release on october 1st  the upcoming aquaman and the lost  kingdom aims to continue the franchise's  track record after the first part gross  over a billion us dollars there's no  doubt that this is very understandable  the release is still quite some time  away but we are glad to see new footage  of the sequel first of all there's a  picture of the popular main character  author curry aka aquaman in addition to  his typical clothing he wears a brand  new suit in the upcoming film which is  much darker fittingly jason memorial  comments as follows on instagram second  round new suit more action as a fan this  is of course great news and many  wondering what this suit is actually all  about after all the fancy design comes  with a handy feature that makes the  wearer invisible so we naturally assume  that the protagonist will have to act  subtly and inconspicuously in the  upcoming sequel well at least at times  there's a lot of speculation at this  point especially in connection with the  underwater kingdom of necros which will  be the focus of the plot of the second  part let's see what happens arthur curry  is not the only one to feature a new  look though as the villain side also  brings news in a picture posted by  director james juan you can see actor  patrick wilson in his role as ocean  master at first sight you might think  you're seeing a meeting between james 1  and robinson cruzo but it is in fact  wilson but all killing aside the reason  for the neglect is not quite clear yet  it could have something to do with the  focus on horror elements in the upcoming  part again we can only speculate here  aquaman and the lost kingdom will hit  theaters on december 16 2022  the huge rig and morty fan community was  quite amazed when they suddenly saw  christopher lloyd in the new teaser for  the fifth season sure rick and his  companion morty are kind of based on  doug brown and marty mcfly from the back  to the future franchise anyway but the  fact that you now get to see lioness  live-action rick is a real surprise  joining him is it star jaden martellus  morty and the regular pickle as pickle  rick okay all jokes aside many fans are  of course wondering what this is all  about since the tweet was posted before  the season finale without any context  it's hard to know whether it's just a  clever pr stunt or if the teaser might  actually reveal a clue about the finale  the only extra information is c132 which  stands for one of the parallel universes  from the rick and morty world might it  be universe where the characters are  embodied by real actors find it out for  yourself because the entire fifth season  is now available to watch as the last  two episodes came out on september 5th  work on mission impossible 7 has already  been underway since january 2019. since  then there has been one major cause for  the project to be talked about and that  is the various postponements of the  release date so to shorten the waiting  time of more than a year we thought you  might enjoy a short summary of  everything that is known about the 7th  part so far let's start with the cast  there are no big surprises at this point  we will see tom cruise as ethan hunt  being reigns as luther stickle simon  pack as benji don rebecca ferguson as  elsa faust and vanessa kirby as alanna  metzopoulos among many others making a  special return is henry cherny as eugene  kiddridge as his character has not been  on screen since the first part in 1996.  behind the camera christopher mcfory is  again the director and scriptwriter and  he and his team are responsible for the  implementation there are still no  details regarding the story but we have  already gotten a glimpse of the  breathtaking stunts of the action  blockbuster the absolute highlight is a  motorcycle jump in which lead actor tom  cruise himself falls down a huge cliff  he refers to it as the most dangerous  stunt of his life which is certainly no  understatement on the part of the 59  year old we will continue to keep you up  to date on upcoming news about mission  impossible unfortunately the release  date of september 30th 2022 is not yet  in sight  mr and mrs smith starring brad pitt and  angelina jolie was released 16 years ago  the film not only laid the foundation  for the relationship between the two  stars which later became world famous  under the name brangelina but was also  an enjoyable action romance rather  suddenly it was announced at the  beginning of the year that a mr and mrs  smith series was being planned under the  direction of showrunner francesca sloane  the two main actors were also already  confirmed mr smith wants to be embodied  by us rapper and actor donald glover  while the female counterpart was to be  given to phoebe waller bridge but as  deadline now reported a few days ago  wallabridge has abruptly quit the  project the reason is believed to have  been creative differences with her  acting colleague donald glover according  to reports the two have parted ways at  least amicably the two months-long  process of the series has now come to  sudden hold and it is now up to sloane  and glover to quickly find an adequate  replacement the situation is different  for walla bridge who is unlikely to be  bored at the moment due to the filming  of indiana jones 5. well the series is  still firmly on the schedule or whether  they might even decide to put the  project on hold is currently uncertain  as is a possible release date of course  [Music]

